The built program (on the disc ../chimera-readbacktest.iso) also contains
code of:

- ps2sdk (https://github.com/ps2dev/ps2sdk): its C library glue, kernel
  and patch (libpatches) libraries. Under the Academic Free License 2.0
  (AFL-2.0.txt in this folder).
- gsKit (https://github.com/ps2dev/gsKit): its graphics and DMA libraries.
  Under the Academic Free License 2.0 (AFL-2.0.txt in this folder).
- newlib (ps2dev's, https://github.com/ps2dev/newlib), the C library the
  toolchain links in, under the licences COPYING.NEWLIB in this folder lists
  (BSD-style and similar permissive ones).

All of it may be copied and redistributed, as source and as a binary, with
these notices. The program was built with the ps2dev/ps2dev v2.0.0 Docker
image (sha256:8e6dc4564598ecce94d078d3111b8c4803f88faa94a6f183ac60240a0ae010a1);
build.sh builds the same bytes again.
